      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 462713251307520
    m_Localized: Language
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 596921324019712
    m_Localized: Great, simulation works. Try walking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 597106221522944
    m_Localized: Try your gun with these dummies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 597415580803072
    m_Localized: They dropped seeds you can use for planting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 598193053769728
    m_Localized: These spots are for sowing, and get more seeds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 598468925726720
    m_Localized: Quick, press the console button to start the wave now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 598922132856832
    m_Localized: We have enough seeds to plant a DEFENSE plant. Let's go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 600133649178624
    m_Localized: Remember that you can start the wave without being near the console.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 621666706792448
    m_Localized: Single shot tower, regular damage and speed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 622412248522752
    m_Localized: Single shot tower, high damage and low speed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 622640276054016
    m_Localized: Slows down nearby creatures
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 623996760104960
    m_Localized: Augments the seeds produced
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 624244391813120
    m_Localized: Single shot tower, regular damage and speed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 624358757900288
    m_Localized: Throws explosives, low damage low speed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 624463024103424
    m_Localized: Throws explosives, low damage low speed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 878113277485056
    m_Localized: Start wave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2906708283891712
    m_Localized: The creatures inside the triangle at your feet will be attacked
      automatically. Eliminate these.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2907732910415872
    m_Localized: Enemies will come from portals, look at the red dot in the nimimap
      and the arrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3138320657424384
    m_Localized: Look, there's a signal where enemies will come. Go there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3138773067636736
    m_Localized: The base is vulnerable. Never let critter get close to it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3142962795651072
    m_Localized: Now plant a turret in the red plot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3161161868124160
    m_Localized: Good, but boost the yield with a SUPPORT plant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6065169500045312
    m_Localized: Seeds are picked up automatically from enemies and windmills.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6772197440716800
    m_Localized: There's plants for SUPPORT, ATACK, and DEFENSE. With a SUPPORT and
      ATTACK one we are good. Go to the red mark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9355523833823232
    m_Localized: range
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10133197970612224
    m_Localized: You can see the damage of turrets and their range to the right of
      the description. And their price below.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11618928334688256
    m_Localized: '''Q'' to begin wave'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
